body.condition:
The moving scalar row laws satisfy
\[
\lim_{\eta\downarrow0}\limsup_{n\to\infty}
\sup_{\substack{P\in\mathcal P_{\mathrm S}:\ 
\gamma_{a,P}\in[1+\epsilon_\gamma,2-\epsilon_\gamma]
\cup[2+\epsilon_\gamma,\overline\gamma]\cup\{\infty\}
\text{ for every }a\in\mathcal A}}
\sup_{\tau\in\mathcal T}\sup_{x\in\mathbb R}
P\bigl\{|Z_{P,n}(\tau)-x|\le\eta\bigr\}=0.
\]
